  "body_html": "<h1>perron_frobenius</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem perron_frobenius (M : Fin n → Fin n → ℝ) (hM_pos : ∀ i j, 0 &lt; M i j) : ∃ (x y : stdSimplex ℝ (Fin n)) (lam : ℝ), 0 &lt; lam ∧ (∀ i, 0 &lt; x.val i) ∧ (∀ i, 0 &lt; y.val i) ∧ (∀ j, wsum x (fun i =&gt; M i j) = lam * x.val j) ∧ (∀ i, wsum y (M i) = lam * y.val i)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>IsPositive</li>\n<li>loomis_theorem</li>\n<li>By_pos</li>\n<li>xB_pos</li>\n</ul>",
